# MaxxOps consumes this release

After you publish `@logimaxx/kgrid`, update the MaxxOps checkout in the same task so it resolves to that version. A caret that already allows it is not enough.

In sibling `maxxops_latest` (or the workspace checkout), `src/frontend`:

- `"kgrid": "npm:@logimaxx/kgrid@^X.Y.Z"`
- refresh the lockfile with npm

Do not point MaxxOps at `file:` or a local tarball. If that checkout is not available, say so and name `src/frontend/package.json`.
